        "original_id": "00e16c6d-99b8-5037-84a7-a1138f852463",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Wu, Guy Ritchie, Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Vincent Pastore, André Benjamin, Anubhav Sinha, Shah Rukh Khan, Arjun Rampal, Kareena Kapoor, Armaan Verma, Shahana Goswami, Kanika Dhillon\n- Places: Hong Kong, Chinatown, London\n- Products: Revolver, Ra.One\n- Topics: film casting, film direction, script origin\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Wu was born in Hong Kong and grew up in Chinatown, London.\n- Revolver is a 2005 British-French crime thriller film co-written and directed by Guy Ritchie.\n- Revolver stars Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Vincent Pastore, and André Benjamin.\n- Ra.One is a 2011 Indian superhero film directed by Anubhav Sinha.\n- Ra.One stars Shah Rukh Khan, Arjun Rampal, Kareena Kapoor, Armaan Verma, Shahana Goswami, and Tom Wu in pivotal roles.\n- The script for Ra.One was written by Anubhav Sinha and Kanika Dhillon.\n- The idea for Ra.One originated when Anubhav Sinha saw a television commercial and then expanded the concept.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
